        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daria Morgendorffer\n- Works: Carousel (comics), Waiting for Godot, Waiting for Go, The Maxx\n- Topics: comic adaptations, literature classics, MTV animated series\n\nFacts:\n- Carousel (comics) creates comic adaptations of literature classics.\n- Waiting for Go is a comic adaptation of Waiting for Godot.\n- Waiting for Go mixes Waiting for Godot with MTV's animated series featuring Daria Morgendorffer.\n- These adaptations are presented under the series title The Maxx.",
